    "https://www.sfu.ca/vpacademic/academic-careers.html": {
      "title": "Provost and VP Academic",
      "description": "Academic Careers - Provost and VP Academic - Simon Fraser University Skip to content Skip to main navigation sfu.ca Faculty & Staff Forms MENU undefined undefined Provost and VP Academic Sign In SFU Mail go SFU Canvas Search undefined This Site SFU.ca Who We Are About Provost's Office Meet the Provost Meet The Team Committees Our Role Academic Planning Resource Planning Budget Office Support Services Institutional Initiatives Awards Distinguished SFU Professors Excellence in Teaching Nora and Ted Sterling Prize Academic Careers Current Openings Administrative Appointments Academic Positions Current Research Chair Opportunities News Faculty & Staff Forms Overview Academic Careers Find administrative, faculty and Canada Research Chair (CRC) career opportunities below. If you are considering an academic position at Simon Fraser University, check out the Faculty Relations website, or, if you have general questions regarding the appointment process for academic appointments, email Faculty Relations at fr_execdir@sfu.ca . ADMINISTRATIVE APPOINTMENTS Find all available senior academic and administrative appointments here, including Dean and Vice-Provost and Associate Vice-President searches. Read more ACADEMIC POSITIONS Find all available faculty positions and other academic positions. Read more CANADA RESEARCH CHAIR OPPORTUNITIES The Canada Research Chairs (CRC) program provides universities the opportunity to recruit world-class scholars across all research disciplines. Find all available CRC positions. Read more COLLECTION NOTICE (ALL APPLICANTS PLEASE READ THIS NOTICE) Personal information which is included with an application for an academic appointment is collected under the authority of the Freedom of Information and Protection of Privacy Act, University Policies A10.01 Academic Appointments, A10.02 Technical Appointments and Procedures, and A10.06 Appointment of Specially Funded University Chairs, University Professors and Research Fellows, and the SFU Faculty Association/SFU Collective Agreement. The information is related directly to and needed by the University to operate its academic personnel management program and appointment competitions. The information will be used to process applications for academic appointments, assess an applicant's qualifications, determine if a recommendation to appoint an applicant has the demonstrated support of the department and make a final appointment decision. Some information will be carried forward to the successful applicant’s personnel file. Each academic unit has its own internal search procedures which means the information may be disclosed to some or all of the following groups within a department: Deans, Associate Deans, Division Heads, Chairs, Directors, Search Committee members, all faculty members, students, and administrative staff. If you have any questions about the collection and use of this information please contact the Director of Faculty Relations, Office of the Provost and Vice President, Academic, fr_director@sfu.ca If you have any questions about the collection and use of this information by the unit to which you have applied, please be in touch with the identified contact person for the search. ACADEMIC POLICIES Please see: https://www.sfu.ca/policies/gazette/academic.html . Provost and VP Academic Who We Are Our Role Awards Academic Careers News Faculty & Staff Forms Contact us 8888 University Drive Burnaby, B.C. Canada V5A 1S6 Safety & Risk SFU Maps & Directions SFU Admissions Road Report Give to SFU Emergency Information A-Z Directory Simon Fraser University respectfully acknowledges the xʷməθkʷəy̓əm (Musqueam), Sḵwx̱wú7mesh Úxwumixw (Squamish), səlilwətaɬ (Tsleil-Waututh), q̓íc̓əy̓ (Katzie), kʷikʷəƛ̓əm (Kwikwetlem), Qayqayt, Kwantlen, Semiahmoo and Tsawwassen peoples on whose unceded traditional territories our three campuses reside. Terms & Conditions Privacy policy © Simon Fraser University Provost and VP Academic Who We Are Overview Abo