e School of Business Communication, Art and Technology Education Environment Health Sciences Library and Archives Science Faculty of Communication, Art and Technology Publishing School for the Contemporary Arts School of Communication School of Interactive Arts and Technology Provost and VP Academic Who We Are Our Role Awards Academic Careers News Faculty & Staff Forms Contact us 8888 University Drive Burnaby, B.C. Canada V5A 1S6 Safety & Risk SFU Maps & Directions SFU Admissions Road Report Give to SFU Emergency Information A-Z Directory Simon Fraser University respectfully acknowledges the xʷməθkʷəy̓əm (Musqueam), Sḵwx̱wú7mesh Úxwumixw (Squamish), səlilwətaɬ (Tsleil-Waututh), q̓íc̓əy̓ (Katzie), kʷikʷəƛ̓əm (Kwikwetlem), Qayqayt, Kwantlen, Semiahmoo and Tsawwassen peoples on whose unceded traditional territories our three campuses reside. Terms & Conditions Privacy policy © Simon Fraser University Provost and VP Academic Who We Are Overview About Provost's Office Meet the Provost Meet The Team Committees Our Role Overview Academic Planning Overview Academic Planning Accreditation External Reviews Curriculum Development General Education (WQB) Requirements Program Development General Education (WQB) Certification Resources Faculty Renewal Enrollment & Class Composition Educational Goals Program-level Educational Goals Institutional Educational Goals Institutional Accountability Resource Planning Overview Finance & Budgeting Space Management Budget Office Overview Current Year Next Year Tuition Setting Budget FAQ's Support Services Overview Learning & Teaching Institutional Initiatives Awards Overview Distinguished SFU Professors Excellence in Teaching Overview SFU Gallery of Teaching Excellence SFU Teaching Awards Nora and Ted Sterling Prize Academic Careers Overview Current Openings Administrative Appointments Academic Positions Current Research Chair Opportunities Overview Canada Impact+ Research Chairs News Faculty & Staff Forms Overview Overview Overview New Facu